⚡️🇺🇸🇮🇷 Preparations for tonight's U.S. strikes against Iran. 

An E-11A BACN communications aggregation aircraft is likely airborne from Prince Sultan Air Base, and there have been repeated USAF tanker takeoffs from bases in Israel; at least four are moving east, the last one having taken off six minutes ago.

